      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1557674410,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I think the biggest issue would be with VARINT and UINT_[BYTES|STRING], which makes it harder to do an early bounds check. Another option is not to initialize the fvalue_t until after retrieving the value to set, which involves a number of internal API changes but is possible.",
