        {
          "id": 1557715320,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Fairly clean, I'm not so sure... It is difficult to get past the fact that `fvalue_free_wmem()` only works with a NULL allocator and it raises some questions on how it would scale to many fvalues, with a callback registered for each fvalue.",
